{"l": 0, "i": 0, "text": "note: Project: AI remake of Ralph Bakshi's Fire and Ice (1983), local-only MiniMax H3 in ComfyUI. Root E:\\FNI. Rigs: 5090 box (192.168.12.177:8188, Linux) = dedicated render; 4090 Windows box = LM Studio + general. Never run LM Studio and an H3 render on the same GPU. Hosted adapters disabled (external_spend_limit 0).", "size": 319}
