{"l": 0, "i": 18, "text": "note: fullrun.py = main pipeline (plan/caption/prompt/render/collect/recover). FL2VA three-field grammar (integrated_multimodal_description/overall_soundscape/non_diegetic_music); REF2VA uses the six-field form. validate_prompt() checks <d> balance, language tags, <=2 speakers, <=130-char lines, <=200-char dialogue; non-fatal.", "size": 328}
{"l": 0, "i": 19, "text": "note: FULL RUN COMPLETE: 494/494 chunks rendered and downloaded (fullrun/output/, 603MB, ledger fullrun/renders.jsonl matches disk exactly). 34 scene stitches in fullrun/stitched/ = 25 film scenes + 9 gap scenes G01-G09. S10 is the only hole: no renders, separate approach via run_scene10_ledger.py + manifests/scene10_ledger.jsonl.", "size": 332}
